Z||000007||PaUL||08-19-99||03:35 PM||||I saw a very interesting fiero once and Ive never seen one like it since. It was a 85 or 86 SC with the original nose and tail but with the V6 option. It looked just like a pre 88 base or SC but with a 2m6 decal on the back. I think this option package was only available in 85 and 86. I bet none of you knew there were non GT or SEs with the V6.
